[ti:Visitor song]
[ar:nishal21 and visitors]
[00:05.00]Someone stopped by late on a quiet night (Nishal K)
[00:07.50]left a single note and went on their way (Nishal K)
[00:10.00]I never got their name until the credits (Nishal K)
[00:12.50]now it plays here every single day (Nishal K)
[00:15.00]One note at a time (Nishal K)
[00:17.50]from people passing through (Nishal K)
[00:20.00]a name beside a line (Nishal K)
[00:22.50]and part of it is you (Nishal K)
[00:25.00]Leave yours and the song gets one beat longer (Nishal K)
